# 🛠️ Configuração do Projeto

## 1️⃣ Clonar o repositório

```bash
git clone https://github.com/seu-usuario/aluno-online.git
```

---

## 2️⃣ Entrar na pasta do projeto

```bash
cd aluno-online
```

---

## 3️⃣ Configurar o banco de dados

Crie um banco no MySQL:

```sql
CREATE DATABASE aluno_online;
```

---

## 4️⃣ Configurar o application.properties

```properties
spring.datasource.url=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/aluno_online
spring.datasource.username=root
spring.datasource.password=sua_senha

spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update
spring.jpa.show-sql=true
spring.jpa.properties.hibernate.format_sql=true
```

---

## 5️⃣ Executar o projeto

Pelo Maven:

```bash
mvn spring-boot:run
```

Ou execute a classe principal:

```java
@SpringBootApplication
public class AlunoOnlineApplication {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SpringApplication.run(AlunoOnlineApplication.class, args);
    }
}
```

